/*!
 * @mainpage food3d_im
 *
 * @section purpose_en [en] What this library measures
 *     Given an empty-tray point cloud and a food point cloud captured in the same coordinate
 *     frame, the library estimates the volume above the observed tray surface. It reports
 *     cubic centimetres, per-component results, and how much of the surface was inferred
 *     rather than measured. It is intended for host-side processing with PCL.
 * @section purpose_zh [zh] 测量对象
 *     输入同一坐标系下拍摄的空烤盘点云和食材点云，库会估算食材高出实测烤盘表面的体积。
 *     结果以立方厘米表示，并给出逐食材块明细，以及多少顶面来自实测、多少来自补洞。
 *     该测量流程依赖 PCL，在主机端运行。
 *
 * @section example_en [en] First measurement
 *     Check file loading and the returned status before reading a volume. The default
 *     input unit is metres; call set_input_unit(LengthUnit::kMillimeter) for millimetre
 *     point clouds.
 * @section example_zh [zh] 首次测量
 *     读取文件和测量结果都需要检查状态。输入点云默认以米为单位；若坐标使用毫米，
 *     请先调用 set_input_unit(LengthUnit::kMillimeter)。
 * @code{.cpp}
 * #include "measurement.hpp"
 * #include <iostream>
 *
 * int main() {
 *     const PointCloud empty = load_pcd("empty_tray.pcd");
 *     const PointCloud food = load_pcd("food.pcd");
 *     if (empty.points.empty() || food.points.empty()) return 1;
 *
 *     const VolumeEstimate result =
 *         FoodVolumeMeasurer().set_baseline({empty}).set_food(food).run();
 *     if (result.status != MeasurementStatus::kSuccess) {
 *         std::cerr << status_to_string(result.status) << '\n';
 *         return 1;
 *     }
 *     std::cout << result.volume_cm3 << " cm3\n";
 * }
 * @endcode
 *
 * @section contract_en [en] Input and result contract
 *     - Keep the camera and tray fixed between empty and food captures. All input frames
 *       must use the same LengthUnit. ROI bounds and distance parameters use metres.
 *     - The empty frames must cover the food footprint. A missing baseline cell is not
 *       replaced with an ideal plane; inspect VolumeEstimate::missing_baseline_cells.
 *     - Check VolumeEstimate::status first. Numeric results are NaN on failure.
 *     - VolumeEstimate::raw_volume_cm3 comes from measured top cells;
 *       VolumeEstimate::interpolated_volume_cm3 comes from accepted filled cells.
 *       Their sum is VolumeEstimate::volume_cm3 on success.
 * @section contract_zh [zh] 输入与结果约定
 *     - 空盘帧与食材帧之间保持相机、烤盘位置不变。所有点云使用同一 LengthUnit。
 *       ROI 边界和距离参数始终用米表示。
 *     - 空盘帧需要覆盖食材足迹；缺少基线的栅格不会用理想平面代替。
 *       可查看 VolumeEstimate::missing_baseline_cells。
 *     - 先检查 VolumeEstimate::status；失败时数值结果为 NaN。
 *     - VolumeEstimate::raw_volume_cm3 对应实测顶面，
 *       VolumeEstimate::interpolated_volume_cm3 对应通过检查的补洞顶面；
 *       成功时两者之和为 VolumeEstimate::volume_cm3。
 *
 * @section method_en [en] How the estimate is formed
 *     A RANSAC plane defines the tray coordinate frame. Empty frames supply median heights
 *     per grid cell. The food frame is unit-normalized, optionally cropped, voxel-downsampled,
 *     and stripped of its dominant background plane. Surviving points are compared with the
 *     measured baseline and clustered by their footprint on that plane. For every accepted
 *     top-surface cell, the height above the baseline is multiplied by cell area. Enclosed
 *     holes may be filled only within a single component and only when the hole guards pass.
 * @section method_zh [zh] 体积如何得到
 *     先用 RANSAC 平面建立烤盘坐标系，空盘帧在每个栅格内提供中值高度。食材帧经过单位换算、
 *     可选裁剪、体素降采样和背景平面去除后，与实测基线比较；剩余点按平面足迹聚类。
 *     每个有效顶面栅格的高度差乘以栅格面积，累加得到体积。封闭孔洞只会在单个连通块内部、
 *     且满足保护条件时补全。
 *
 * @section inspect_en [en] Inspecting intermediate clouds
 *     Set FoodVolumeMeasurer::set_middle_cloud_dir to a nonempty path. A successful run writes
 *     stage PCD files there. Compare 5_top_surface.pcd (measured cells) with
 *     6_hole_filled_surface.pcd (measured and accepted filled cells). Set an empty path to
 *     disable the dump. The files use world coordinates.
 * @section inspect_zh [zh] 检查中间点云
 *     将 FoodVolumeMeasurer::set_middle_cloud_dir 设为非空目录。成功测量后可比较
 *     5_top_surface.pcd（实测顶面）与 6_hole_filled_surface.pcd（实测加已补全顶面）。
 *     空路径表示不保存；这些 PCD 使用世界坐标。
 *
 * @see FoodVolumeMeasurer, MeasurementConfig, VolumeEstimate
 * @since 1.0
 */
